    <h1>🏦 Banking Awareness</h1>
    <p>Learn the basics of banking.</p>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>1. What is a Bank?</h2>
        <p>A bank is a financial institution that accepts deposits and provides loans.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>2. Savings Account</h2>
        <p>A savings account helps people deposit money and earn interest.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>3. ATM</h2>
        <p>An ATM allows customers to withdraw cash and perform other banking activities.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>4. Loans</h2>
        <p>A loan is money borrowed from a bank that must be repaid with applicable interest.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>5. IFSC Code</h2>
        <p>IFSC is an 11-character code used to identify a bank branch for electronic transfers.</p>
    </div>

